SENTENCE | Plays mcl-hq from a fresh scratch copy with its real verbs: mine a stone and two logs, craft planks twice and a third time with no log, hold and place a block, and meet the refusals (taken cell, scenery, a block not in the bag).
SENTENCE | A placed block stops a walker until it is mined; then save, new game (the blocks come back from rooms.pdl), load, and a ledger replay in a fresh game that must equal the bags and reopen the same mined blocks; every phase checks the ledger, ui.txt and files.
